            "characterId": "7dce9553-65bb-400b-9970-de7217fdd43d",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2095",
            "content": {
                "en": "The stewardess’s eyes were filled with disgust, as if Veris were nothing more than prey to her.",
                "zh": "乘务员的眼神充斥着厌恶，也许在她眼里何以真不过是猎物。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1652.0,
            "positionY": 664.7999877929688,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f36f50ce-b227-47e7-b2dd-abe0b994b5b0",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "fe717acf-a852-4395-beb4-8cbc7dc92d14",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2080",
            "content": {
                "en": "Ma’am, please don’t bother the passengers up front.",
                "zh": "哎呀女士，不可以去打扰前面的客人。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -1284.800048828125,
            "positionY": 208.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "ad1bb87b-0a23-4d42-beba-88839377510a",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "fe717acf-a852-4395-beb4-8cbc7dc92d14",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2081",
            "content": {
                "en": "The restroom for economy class is all the way at the other end.",
                "zh": "经济舱的洗手间，在另一边最远处哦。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -910.3999633789063,
            "positionY": 208.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
